<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>

  <p>
    Call of Duty: Mobile was launching DMZ: Recon, an extraction mode meant to
    become the third pillar of the game alongside multiplayer and Battle Royale.
    Activision needed the launch to land with the existing community and beyond
    it, in front of players of competing mobile shooters who had never tried
    COD: Mobile.
  </p>
</div>

