<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Awareness first, then proof of depth.</p>
  <p>
    Neither event alone would have told the whole story. The Extract-A-Thon was
    a low-pressure, open front door for players of every skill level. The
    Invitational followed as proof of depth: high-stakes, strategic and
    competitive.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Meeting players where they live</p>
  <p>
    Viewers could watch directly inside the game, earning automatic watch
    rewards, and every two hours a stream giveaway rewarded those who tuned in
    on the broadcast. Creators from PUBG MOBILE, Arena Breakout and Delta Force
    Mobile joined COD: Mobile and PC creators, populating each roster with
    partners from different backgrounds.
  </p>
</div>

