<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Challenges kept everyone on their toes</p>
  <p>
    Custom-built technology powered real-time challenge-tracking overlays on the
    main broadcast and on every creator’s stream. Wherever a viewer tuned in,
    they could see team progress, challenge status and whether the multiplier
    was live, all managed in realtime by the tournament ops team.
  </p>
</div>

