<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <p class="big">A level field</p>
    <p>
      Every team played on freshly provisioned tournament accounts, so placement
      came down to in-event decisions and not to prior progression. We created
      the accounts and recommended level, skill point and premium currency
      changes for Activision to apply.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="big">A full broadcast package</p>
    <p>
      Every screen the audience saw was designed as one animated system:
      starting-soon and be-right-back screens, squad and roster boards,
      challenge explainers, milestone reward and loot leaderboards, creator cams
      and an end slate.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

