<h2>The Impact</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    <b>Extract-A-Thon:</b> 56.6K peak concurrent viewers across the official and
    creator streams. 4.2M impressions, 2.3M views and 341K hours watched.
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>Invitational:</b> 4.1M impressions, 1.6M views and 70K hours watched
    across 30 creators, with a peak of 29K concurrent viewers.
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>Together:</b> 2 events, 52 creators and 8.3M+ impressions to launch DMZ:
    Recon.
  </p>
</div>

